# Tenants that may set aegis.eval.run.id / aegis.fault.injection.id (#36, ADR-0005): their
# marked traces are kept at 100% by the gateway. A YAML list, read by the agent and the
# gateway alike (ConfigMap eval-tenants). In kind only tenant-eval, the tenant of eval runs such as
# `make fixtures-agentic-rag` (#12); tenant-a and tenant-b may not mark traces.
TRACEBLAME_EVAL_TENANTS=[tenant-eval]
